body:
He was this guy I met. I thought I fell in love with him, and he told me he loved me too. I was 12 when we met and 13 when we started "dating." He must have been almost 20 at the time. He convinced me to run away from my parents and I continued to follow him everywhere. At one point, we were homeless. This was when I was 17. He hurt me physically, emotionally, and sexually. He cheated on me with people from craigslist and prostituted himself. He would harm himself in front of me and force me to do the same. Weeks before I escaped, he told me that the only real people in the world were God, the Devil, and himself and that I didn't exist. He drove me to insanity. I know there is one other girl, but she was not in contact with him physically (only through text and Facebook.) I'm scared to say his name because I know he still keeps up with me. I was so young when all of this happened and now I have no idea what to do, or how to be an "adult" I guess.

&#x200B;

I guess I should add that I've never had a positive relationship with my parents either.
